    {"uid":"zhcn:c71bf51cc6e38ea2f643bfea","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风要来试试\r\n用在训练上的恶作剧喔！","source_fingerprint":"a96ab245aa03b2a41c6f10637f338a51934acdb6e73fe16193436ac8333c7567","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","110000"],"entry_index":76,"target_text":"Windy sẽ thử\r\nmấy trò nghịch áp dụng vào training!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:203f23669d3b9b48606260fe","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这本书看起来\r\n好像有咬一口的价值喔！","source_fingerprint":"2a28e0021b41de72ef5f977d6800dbfa0afb48badd7aacbac97d1071e56ab14b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","110001"],"entry_index":77,"target_text":"Cuốn sách này trông\r\ncó vẻ đáng để cắn thử một miếng!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:01e9013d4660f9667cf224fa","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"让风风参赛啦！\r\n风风想大闹一场啦──！","source_fingerprint":"487319dbd00015f18b979409015f2829840133f2fb06f783935c21b2de6bf856","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","110002"],"entry_index":78,"target_text":"Cho Windy tham gia race đi!\r\nWindy muốn quậy tung một trận──!","reviewed":true},
